* generic_ind.lib - generic linear inductor model with temperature
* coefficients. AUTHORED (not derived from any vendor file). Trivial
* disposable test-fixture model.
*
* USAGE (verified against ngspice 47):
*   .include models/inductors/generic_ind.lib
*   L1 n1 n2 LGEN inductance=<value>   ; model name right after nodes,
*                                       then inductance=value.
*   NOTE: neither "L1 n1 n2 <value> LGEN" (positional, like R) nor
*   "L1 n1 n2 LGEN L=<value>" work in ngspice 47 - the first errors
*   "unknown parameter (lgen)", the second errors "unknown parameter
*   (l)" because the inductor instance parameter is named "inductance"
*   (no "L" alias), unlike the capacitor which does alias "C".
*   Confirmed via ngspice's own `devhelp inductor`.

.model LGEN L (TC1=0 TC2=0 TNOM=27)
